4.jpg"}, {"id": 610565, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scd345.jpg"}, {"id": 610566, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scd346.jpg"}, {"id": 610567, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scd347.jpg"}], "slug": "grunnd", "storyline": "You find yourself fighting to stay awake on your evening train ride home from work until sleep finally takes you. You wake up to find that you've missed your stop.\n\nIn a panic, you jump off at the next station and attempt to get your bearings. Unfortunately, getting a grasp on exactly where you\u2019ve ended up turns out to be more difficult than you\u2019d thought.\n\nThe people you encounter here are strange, and while they fancy themselves helpful in their own ways, they aren\u2019t seemingly helpful in the ways that would see you quickly on your journey back home. The air here is thick and strange, and just beyond the reach of your senses something ethereal and omnipotent observes your every move from the sky.", "summary": "This is a 100% handcrafted point and click adventure about traveling to a seemingly ordinary place, right next to you that slowly introduces itself as a surreal and twisted world that has it's own invisible gods, agendas, and order.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/grunnd", "videos": [{"id": 82934, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "EZvyGU6kB94", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EZvyGU6kB94", "title": "GRUNND | Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EZvyGU6kB94/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}